-- BATCH 0518-0535, AFTER. A PROD CHECK: read-only, ONE statement (begin read only ... rollback), the gate first.
--   npx --yes supabase@2.120.0 db query --linked --output-format json -f scripts/ops/harness/batch-0518-0535/after.sql
-- Gathers the slices' own checks (scripts/ops/harness/<slice>/), which stay the detail of each.
-- Expect: head 20260818000535; bodies_off []; missing []; knobs_off []; reach []; asks 0; runs {0, 0, 0, 0}; fleets_on_rounds {0, 0}; badges 0, badges_out_of_book 0 ALWAYS;
--   artifacts 0. LIT, +30 minutes: overdue_30m 0, without_run 0, neither_or_both 0 ALWAYS; job_ms_30m within 20 ms of before.
-- Reads: arrivals_beats (5 minutes), pg_class, pg_stat_activity, the catalog, world_config by key, small tables by count. Only STABLE functions are
--   called, none writes. The digests are of the local chain's world (PGlite, migrations to 0535).
